        "link": "/news/2026-08-05/bondi-antisemitism-royal-commission-virginia-bell-hijack-claim/106997564",
        "title": "Commissioner rebukes claim pro-Palestinian groups tried to 'hijack' hearing",
        "content": {
          "descriptor": {
            "type": "tagname",
            "key": "div",
            "props": {},
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tagname",
                "key": "@@standfirst",
                "props": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "The royal commission on antisemitism has hit back at comments from a prominent member of the Jewish community who accused pro-Palestinian groups of attempting to \"hijack\" the inquiry using \"clickbait theatrics and gratuitous slurs\"."
                  }
